{
    "title": "SWF Solar Planets Watch Face",
    "description": "IMPORTANT: Requires at minimum Wear OS API level 28 or higher to work (e.g. Samsung Watch 4 or other Wear OS API level 28+ compatible devices).\r\n\r\nTAP (hold 3 sec) anywhere on the watch face and select customize to assign up to 8 customized apps and to change the appearance of the watch face to create thousands different design combinations.\r\n\r\nExperience our 8 planet solar system on the SWF Solar with a speed of 43800:1. The earth on the SWF Solar orbits the sun once within 12 minutes, while the earth normally needs 1 year for it. On the SWF Solar 120 earth years pass in one day and the earth orbits the sun 120 times. All 8 planets (Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus and Neptune) move 43800 times faster as their real speeds so that the movement of the planets on the clock can be perceived and followed live.\r\n\r\nThe SWF Solar V2 Planets PRO Series impresses with a detailed animated clockwork and allows you to create thousands of different combinations by freely combining border, bezel, glas, lines, numerals, hands and colors. The PRO Series allows you to configure up to 8 custom apps on your watch face. \r\n\r\nThe SWF Solar V2 Planets Edition represents time in an extraordinary, timeless and elegant style while it combines pure classic style and minimalism with a clear and modern design.  \r\n\r\nSWF Swiss Watch Faces are crafted and made in Switzerland and showing an very high grade of details. The SWF Solar V2 contains a beautiful animated clockwork and a high color AOD watch face for your watch, so you can leave your watch always on while you are on the go.\r\n\r\nREQUIREMENTS: Requires at minimum Wear OS API level 28 or higher to work. Due to use of effects and animation this watch face may use more battery power than completely non animated ones. Videos and images are for illustrative purposes only, products shown on the store images may differ from the final product on your watch. The final product may look different due to the size and LCD display of the watch and slight colour deviations from the final product are possible. No liability is assumed for any damages caused by incorrect information or the use of this product.",
    "descriptionHTML": "IMPORTANT: Requires at minimum Wear OS API level 28 or higher to work (e.g. Samsung Watch 4 or other Wear OS API level 28+ compatible devices).<br><br>TAP (hold 3 sec) anywhere on the watch face and select customize to assign up to 8 customized apps and to change the appearance of the watch face to create thousands different design combinations.<br><br>Experience our 8 planet solar system on the SWF Solar with a speed of 43800:1. The earth on the SWF Solar orbits the sun once within 12 minutes, while the earth normally needs 1 year for it. On the SWF Solar 120 earth years pass in one day and the earth orbits the sun 120 times. All 8 planets (Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus and Neptune) move 43800 times faster as their real speeds so that the movement of the planets on the clock can be perceived and followed live.<br><br>The SWF Solar V2 Planets PRO Series impresses with a detailed animated clockwork and allows you to create thousands of different combinations by freely combining border, bezel, glas, lines, numerals, hands and colors. The PRO Series allows you to configure up to 8 custom apps on your watch face. <br><br>The SWF Solar V2 Planets Edition represents time in an extraordinary, timeless and elegant style while it combines pure classic style and minimalism with a clear and modern design.  <br><br>SWF Swiss Watch Faces are crafted and made in Switzerland and showing an very high grade of details. The SWF Solar V2 contains a beautiful animated clockwork and a high color AOD watch face for your watch, so you can leave your watch always on while you are on the go.<br><br>REQUIREMENTS: Requires at minimum Wear OS API level 28 or higher to work. Due to use of effects and animation this watch face may use more battery power than completely non animated ones. Videos and images are for illustrative purposes only, products shown on the store images may differ from the final product on your watch. The final product may look different due to the size and LCD display of the watch and slight colour deviations from the final product are possible. No liability is assumed for any damages caused by incorrect information or the use of this product.",
